mem 240 gb
 
KinOrder   10  (Max order in the kinetic energy expansion)
PotOrder   12   (Max order in the potential energy expansion)

Natoms 3      (Number of atoms)
Nmodes 3      (Number of modes = 3*Natoms-6)

(ACTIVE SPACE CUTOFFS:)
PRIMITIVES
  Npolyads       24           (how many polyads we calculate)
  enercut       100000.      (energy cut in the primitive matrix for the diagonalization)
END



CONTRACTION
  Npolyads        24      (how many polyads in the contracted represent.)
  enercut       28000.    (energy cut in the primitive matrix for the diagonalization)
  degeneracy    1e-2       (threashold to define degeneracy)
  sample_points   40
  sample_attempts 500
  symm_toler      1e-3
  coeff_thresh    1e-18   (  rotsym        euler )
  model j=0
END
    
verbose 4


dstep 0.001   (finite difference element for each mode )

COORDS       local   (type of the internal coordinates: linear or local)
TRANSFORM    R2-Z-R1-ALPHA-ABS
MOLTYPE      XY2    (Identifying type of the Molecule (e.g. XY3))
MOLECULE     HOCl   (Identifying the Molecule, e.g. PH3, BiH3 - optional)
REFER-CONF   RIGID  (Reference configuarion: RIGID or NON-RIGID)



SYMGROUP Cs


ZMAT
    O   0  0  0  0   15.99059462
    H   1  0  0  0   1.00782503224
   Cl   1  2  0  0   34.965012622636 
end


DIAGONALIZER  
 SYEV 
 enermax 24000
end


CHECK_POINT
HAMILTONIAN none ascii
potential   read
kinetic     read
external    read
basis_set   read
CONTRACT    read
matelem     none  split
extmatelem  read  split  1 374
EIGENFUNC   read
fit_poten   read  split  1 374
END



